=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Halver} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} for a cutscene to begin the mission.
** The {@k} {k:Memorian, the Magicked Doll} will be activated in this cutscene.
** You will also receive {@k} {k:Trion's directive} afterwards.
* Speak with {p:Rahal} in the Royal Knight's quarters for another cutscene.
** The {@k} {k:Memorian, the Magicked Doll} will be activated in this cutscene.

=2 Retrieving Lost Memories
[Previous Mission Memories
The following portion of this mission is Not required to continue in the missions, but the background received makes these following cutscenes worth completing.
* Speaking to the following NPCs will give a cutscene. These can be done anytime.
** {n:Honoi-Gomoi} in {z:Windurst Waters}, second floor from the back of the Trader's Home at (E-7, South Map)
** {n:Dancing Wolf} in {z:Rabao} (G-7)
** {n:Rahi Fohlatti} in {z:Rabao} (G-9)
** {n:Ghatsad} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (I-7)
** Zone into {z:Palborough Mines} from {z:North Gustaberg}
*** Casting {s:Escape} after warping to the Home Point takes you to the entrance.
*** Alternately, you can take the Survival Guide to {z:Oldton Movalpolos} and walk back outside to North Gustaberg, then head north.
* The two below are part of The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4, and you may have them completed if you did the above steps already.
** Speak to {p:Halver} in {z:Chateau d'Oraguille} for {p:Trion} and {p:Excenmille}.
** Speak with {p:Rahal} in the Royal Knight's quarters for {p:Rahal} and **Altennia**.
* After restoring all memories, you will receive the {@k} {k:Depleted Memorian}.
** **This will only be received after you have finished The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-4.**
* Return to {p:Shantotto} for a cutscene, where she will take the {@k} {k:Depleted Memorian}.

]
* Head to {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} with multiple {@i:Pickaxe|605} {i:Pickaxes|Pickaxe|605}. Locate **Mining Points** around the zone to obtain {@k}{k:Ember-encrusted orichalcum}.
** {n:Ostalie}, {z:Southern San d'Oria} (E-9) near HP #4 sells {@i:Pickaxe|605} Pickaxes.

* Use the {z:Ifrit's Cauldron} Unity warp (iLvl 125), and follow the provided route to visit every location until it is found.
** There are 7 correct Mining Points and 5 wrong ones.
*** The correct spots are: Map 5 (G-8), Map 3 (J-7), Map 3 (F-7), Map 4 (F-7), Map 1 (F-9), Map 1 (G-8), Map 7 (I-10).
** Most of the correct spots are located outdoors and will give the key item on the very first hit.
** The correct mining spot cycles with the other correct ones so you only have to check them if doing this with multiple people.
** The correct mining spot can only be seen by players who are on this mission and don't already have the {@k}{k:Ember-encrusted orichalcum} in their inventory.
** If a mining spot gives items then it is not the correct mining spot.
** If you receive the "Event skipped." message due to aggro when mining the correct spot, your log will not show that you received the key item.
*** Check your Temporary Key Items list to be sure you received it in this case.
* Return to {p:Rahal} for the final cutscene and your reward.
** At this point, the {@k} {k:Memorian, the Magicked Doll} will also signal that your quest is complete if you have obtained all of the other memories.
*** {M:See the hidden mission entry|The Voracious Resurgence Mission 7-3|Koru-Moru's Hypothesis} for details on this sub-task and retrieving the rest of the memories if you did not receive the {@k}. {k:Depleted Memorian} at the end of this mission.

